rate) with a fem S/o thats a doll like demon with a Gothic Lolita style and for unknown reasons she gives off a cold, gloomy and really creepy aura/vibe but becomes a sweetheart after warming up to them</p></div><div class="k31gt Me1c9"><p></p></div><div class="k31gt Me1c9"><p> (a little example for the whole goth lolita thing, frilly dresses, ruffles, lace stokings/tights, curled hair, deep red roses, and Dark colors the whole nine yards)</p></div><div class="k31gt Me1c9"><p></p></div><div class="NDQyX"><button class="TRX6J k4_Vq seYEy" aria-label="Изображение"><span class="EvhBA" tabindex="-1"><figure class="DdFPj jW0Y3"><div class="HsI7c" style="padding-bottom:55.55555555555556%"><img class="RoN4R" decoding="sync" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 540px) 100vw, 300px" srcset="https://64.media.tumblr.com/ae36e0abceb1ea3382985314a0aac409/fa7b5c6ec38849c9-6c/s100x200/f7b0330879277edc7baf46ea1de546c2f67f4da4.gifv 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ae36e0abceb1ea3382985314a0aac409/fa7b5c6ec38849c9-6c/s250x400/34c54656888fa1f21792e6022e0810224f3bd37d.gifv 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ae36e0abceb1ea3382985314a0aac409/fa7b5c6ec38849c9-6c/s400x600/cac8db86abdbc35e7bd6bd1e781bb586e385f40c.gifv 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ae36e0abceb1ea3382985314a0aac409/fa7b5c6ec38849c9-6c/s500x750/cbd72e988ef68a475a50874bc481a4d91f6813df.gifv 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ae36e0abceb1ea3382985314a0aac409/fa7b5c6ec38849c9-6c/s540x810/570c75379e0809808960243950ab97360fce2c0b.gifv 540w"><img alt="" class="GmPch tPU70" decoding="sync" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 540px) 100vw, 300px" srcset="https://44.media.tumblr.com/ae36e0abceb1ea3382985314a0aac409/fa7b5c6ec38849c9-6c/s75x75_c1_f1/d644776ab9937d2425fc1de9c1de25f7c20b71bd.gifv 75w, https://44.media.tumblr.com/ae36e0abceb1ea3382985314a0aac409/fa7b5c6ec38849c9-6c/s100x200_f1/1e6aa7320d4d1f8a9b8f727a55274fcc3a184c07.gifv 100w, https://44.media.tumblr.com/ae36e0abceb1ea3382985314a0aac409/fa7b5c6ec38849c9-6c/s250x400_f1/d4a91b