</small></li><li class="k31gt Me1c9"><small>1 event banner</small></li></ul><div class="k31gt Me1c9"><p><em><strong>credit is required.</strong></em> <small>please don't redistribute, and </small><small><strong>like/reblog this post</strong></small><small> if you plan on using these resources.</small> if you like this, consider tipping me<em>!</em></p></div><div class="k31gt Me1c9"><h2><strong><a href="https://payhip.com/b/e5OlV" rel="noopener" target="_blank">download on payhip</a></strong>. <small>♡</small></h2></div></div></span></div></div><div class="EOh1c"><button class="tlqck hfWGA">Развернуть</button></div></div><div class="qYXF9 ouMsp"><div class="hAFp3 uXaAK U7mrl" style="max-height: 100px;"><div class="mwjNz"><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/admin%20pack"><span aria-label="admin pack">#admin pack</span></a><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/mod%20pack"><span aria-label="mod pack">#mod pack</span></a><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/rph"><span aria-label="rph">#rph</span></a><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/rpt"><span aria-label="rpt">#rpt</span></a><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/rp%20template"><span aria-label="rp template">#rp template</span></a><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/template%20psd"><span aria-label="template psd">#template psd</span></a><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/graphic%20template"><span aria-label="graphic template">#graphic template</span></a><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/templates%20by%20mauve."><span aria-label="templates by mauve.">#templates by mauve.</span></a><a class="KSDLH" data-testid="tag-link" href="https://www.tumblr.com/tagged/supportcontentcreators"><span aria-label="supportconte